stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Registered: Register(key)<br/>唯一登记 + 记 registered_at

    state 四方仲裁（原子首胜 Complete） {
        Registered --> Resolved: Dispatch → Resolve(key,value)
        Registered --> TimedOut: deadline 到 → kTimeout
        Registered --> Cancelled: 取消令牌 → kCancelled
        Registered --> Failed: FailAll(error)<br/>Close=kClosed / 断连=kConnection
    }

    Resolved --> Finalized
    TimedOut --> Finalized: Wait 先 Complete(error) 置终结<br/>(抢输则采用真正终结结果)
    Cancelled --> Finalized
    Failed --> Finalized

    Finalized --> Evicted: 从表摘除 entry<br/>(按身份匹配，不误删同键新登记)
    Evicted --> [*]

    note right of Registered
        每个在途 entry 复用一个
        SharedCompletion 作值信箱；
        四方抢同一 Complete → 恰好一次终结
    end note
